---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import '../../styles/fileflex.css';
import '../../styles/platform.css';
import '../../styles/partner.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Become a FileFlex ZTDA Technology Partner | FileFlex Enterprise"
  description="FileFlex ZTDA Technology Partners integrate, embed, OEM or create specialized offerings with the FileFlex Enterprise Zero Trust Data Access platform — backed by a full-service support and development team."
>

<Nav current="partner" />

<!-- ============================================================
     HERO
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="ptr-hero" class="sp-hero" aria-labelledby="ptr-hero-heading">
  <div class="ptr-hero__inner">
    <h1 id="ptr-hero-heading" class="ptr-hero__title">
      Become a FileFlex ZTDA Technology Partner
    </h1>
    <p class="ptr-hero__lede">
      FileFlex ZTDA Technology Partners include leading hardware and software companies, cloud
      solution providers, application developers and cybersecurity leaders. The benefits are
      substantial and include a full-service support and development team to work on integrations
      with you. The benefit is that you enhance your products and bring a ZTDA solution to them.
    </p>
    <div class="ptr-hero__ctas">
      <a class="ptr-btn ptr-btn--orange" href="/partner-form/">
        <span>Join Our Partner Team</span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     INTEGRATE — H2 centered + 2-column text intro
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="sp-ready" class="pf-section pf-section--white" aria-labelledby="sp-ready-heading">
  <div class="pf-section__inner">
    <h2 id="sp-ready-heading" class="pf-title pf-title--center sp-ready__title">
      Integrate FileFlex Enterprise — solve the problem of unstructured data and mitigate ransomware with the new benchmark for zero trust data access and sharing
    </h2>
    <div class="sp-ready__cols">
      <p>
        The ZTDA Technology Partner Program is a large-scale relationship. You are able to integrate,
        embed, OEM or create specialized offerings as a ZTDA Technology Partner. We help you to meet
        the ZTDA requirements of your customers by certifying integrations with the FileFlex
        Enterprise platform.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our ZTDA Technology Partners get pricing benefits, full marketing and technical support, lead
        referrals, an assigned Success Manager and ongoing access to valuable product content and
        webinars.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     PARTNER LOGOS BAND
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="tp-logos" class="tp-logos" aria-label="FileFlex technology partners">
  <div class="tp-logos__inner">
    <img
      src="/images/partner/technology-partner/LOGOS-cropped.jpg"
      alt="FileFlex Enterprise technology and integration partner logos"
      width="1751"
      height="233"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     THE PROBLEMS YOU SOLVE
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="tp-problems" class="pf-section pf-section--white" aria-labelledby="tp-problems-heading">
  <div class="pf-section__inner">
    <h2 id="tp-problems-heading" class="pf-title pf-title--center">The Problems You Solve</h2>
    <p class="tp-problems__intro">
      Today's organizations are finding it increasingly difficult for their hybrid workforce to
      access, share and protect the unstructured data that has become the new normal. With FileFlex
      Enterprise as a service you help to solve the following problems:
    </p>
    <ul class="tp-problems__list">
      <li>Increased cyber threats such as data exfiltration and ransomware that traditional perimeter defenses fail to stop.</li>
      <li>Managing the proliferation of disparate Microsoft 365, OneDrive, SharePoint and Azure storage.</li>
      <li>The problems of duplication, syncing and VPN access breaches.</li>
      <li>Operating safely in a complex, hybrid, unstructured data environment of on-premises, cloud-hosted and SharePoint repositories.</li>
      <li>Multi-domain challenges — many diverse data repositories that can be located anywhere in the world.</li>
      <li>Hybrid workforce access, sharing, silo and security issues for contractors and gig-based workers.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="tp-problems__close">
      Your hosted solution is FileFlex Enterprise — the only Zero Trust Data Access solution that is a
      fully integrated Windows overlay service enabling zero trust remote unified access and
      governance to unstructured data located in multi-domain, hybrid-IT infrastructures
      (on-premises, Cloud, Azure, AWS, Google and SharePoint storage).
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     HOW WE SUPPORT — orange band heading
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="sp-support-head" class="sp-support-head" aria-labelledby="ptr-support-heading">
  <div class="pf-section__inner">
    <h2 id="ptr-support-heading" class="sp-support-head__title">How We Support Our ZTDA Partners</h2>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="ptr-support" class="pf-section" aria-label="Partner support detail rows">
  <div class="pf-section__inner">
    <div class="ptr-support__rows">
      <!-- Row 1: Partner Success Team — text LEFT, image RIGHT -->
      <article class="ptr-srow ptr-srow--flip">
        <div class="ptr-srow__img" style="background-image:url('/images/partner/technology-partner/iStock-826232986DUO-web.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ptr-srow__body">
          <p class="ptr-srow__eyebrow">Partner Success</p>
          <h3 class="ptr-srow__title">Partner Success Team</h3>
          <p class="ptr-srow__copy">
            Your success is our goal. Within 24 hours of registering, members of our Partner Success
            Team will contact you and get you up and running on our program. And, when you need some
            advice, the ZTDA Success Team will be there to help out.
          </p>
          <p class="ptr-srow__copy">
            Partner with FileFlex and we'll help you build and sustain a profitable customer
            relationship with our solutions. You will get product discounts, support and ongoing
            access to valuable content and webinars.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Row 2: Smart Marketing Tools — image LEFT, text RIGHT -->
      <article class="ptr-srow">
        <div class="ptr-srow__img" style="background-image:url('/images/partner/technology-partner/iStock-1211994283DUO-web.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ptr-srow__body">
          <p class="ptr-srow__eyebrow">Sales &amp; Marketing</p>
          <h3 class="ptr-srow__title">Smart Marketing Tools to Increase Sales</h3>
          <p class="ptr-srow__copy">
            Close more deals and upsell more clients with proven sales and marketing assets. With
            campaigns-in-a-box, pricing and positioning guides, and demos at your fingertips, you've
            got everything you need to grow revenue, reduce churn, and ensure your success.
          </p>
          <ul class="ptr-srow__list">
            <li><strong>Account Dashboard</strong> — Get a quick summary of your account status.</li>
            <li><strong>Content Hub</strong> — Access our marketing content so you can provide your customers with useful information.</li>
            <li><strong>Support</strong> — Submit support requests to your assigned sales engineer.</li>
            <li><strong>Sales</strong> — Check out the latest materials, promotions and development programs plus pricing and licensing information.</li>
            <li><strong>Training</strong> — Send your technicians to attend our training seminars to receive certification.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Row 3: Certified ZTDA Education — text LEFT, image RIGHT -->
      <article class="ptr-srow ptr-srow--flip">
        <div class="ptr-srow__img" style="background-image:url('/images/partner/technology-partner/iStock-914788014DUO-web.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ptr-srow__body">
          <p class="ptr-srow__eyebrow">Certification</p>
          <h3 class="ptr-srow__title">Certified ZTDA Education Program</h3>
          <p class="ptr-srow__copy">
            We want to make you experts. Our on-demand instruction program for technical and sales
            professionals is designed to enhance your zero trust data cybersecurity knowledge. Our
            ZTDA Programs include sales and support training, sales engineer certification and
            webinars to help you overcome today's and tomorrow's cyber challenges.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Row 4: Learn More — image LEFT, text RIGHT -->
      <article class="ptr-srow">
        <div class="ptr-srow__img" style="background-image:url('/images/partner/technology-partner/iStock-1291478674DUO-web.jpg')" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="ptr-srow__body">
          <p class="ptr-srow__eyebrow">Resources</p>
          <h3 class="ptr-srow__title">Learn More About Latest FileFlex Enterprise ZTDA</h3>
          <p class="ptr-srow__copy">
            Keep up with the latest news, posts, events, webinars and more. In our Virtual Learning
            Centre you can get the latest news and all kinds of whitepapers, webinars, blogs,
            brochures and other education resources.
          </p>
          <div class="sp-resources">
            <a class="ptr-btn ptr-btn--orange" href="/blog/" rel="noopener">
              <span>FileFlex Blog</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a class="ptr-btn ptr-btn--orange" href="/webinars/all-webinars/">
              <span>Explore Webinars</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     FINAL CTA
     ============================================================ -->
<section id="sp-final" class="sp-final" aria-labelledby="sp-final-heading">
  <div class="sp-final__inner">
    <h2 id="sp-final-heading" class="sr-only">Join Our Partner Team</h2>
    <a class="ptr-btn ptr-btn--orange" href="/partner-form/">
      <span>Join Our Partner Team</span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="13 6 19 12 13 18"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Hero background override — technology-partner (server-room data banner) */
  #ptr-hero.sp-hero {
    background: #0b1224 url('/images/partner/technology-partner/iStock-1226864145DUO-web.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
  }

  /* 2-column text intro under H2 */
  .sp-ready__title { max-width: 1100px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .sp-ready__cols {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px 56px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    color: #51606F;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .sp-ready__cols p { margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .sp-ready__cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
  }

  /* Partner logos band */
  .tp-logos {
    background: #3b4f6a;
    padding: 48px 6vw 64px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .tp-logos__inner { max-width: 1024px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .tp-logos__inner img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Problems You Solve */
  .tp-problems__intro,
  .tp-problems__close {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    color: #51606F;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .tp-problems__list {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 32px auto 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px 40px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    color: #51606F;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .tp-problems__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 28px;
  }
  .tp-problems__list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: #e8590a;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .tp-problems__list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* Orange support heading band */
  .sp-support-head {
    background: #e8590a;
    padding: 56px 6vw;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .sp-support-head__title {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.89vw, 37px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Resources buttons (Learn More section) */
  .sp-resources {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  /* Final CTA band */
  .sp-final {
    background: #394f66;
    padding: 60px 6vw;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .sp-final__inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .sr-only {
    position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0,0,0,0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0;
  }
</style>

</Layout>
